  "chunks": [
    {
      "hash": "a2826176226e22afc801d8887e07131b",
      "translation": "# Style Guide\n\nThis directory contains engineering discipline and writing standards for the ErisPulse project."
    },
    {
      "hash": "2bbfb4e3bc57a5ece3d8b487cc697dca",
      "translation": "## Document List\n\n- [Glossary (Single Source of Truth)](glossary.md) - The sole definition of drift-prone terms such as Client/HttpClient, storage/env/StorageManager, BaseConfig/AdapterConfig, the three dimensions of scope, ownership, and service contract/catalog/whitelist\n- [Comment Style Guidelines](docstring.md) - Formatting standards for method comments and docstrings, and the tag parsing contract\n- [Engineering Robustness Rules](engineering.md) - Exception trace grading, log leveling, centralized behavior parameters, API contracts, singleton back-reference prohibitions, cleanup and rollback discipline, and testing discipline\n- [Documentation and External Writing Rules](docs-writing.md) - Documentation writing style, version annotations, the three-part structure for README and release pages, scenario-based expression, and changelog writing"
    },
    {
      "hash": "eb8f2a2249fdb18046b48845b65058ef",
      "translation": "## Audience\n\n- ErisPulse core contributors  \n- Module and adapter developers  \n- Contributors maintaining README and external pages  \n- Developers who need to generate API documentation"
    },
    {
      "hash": "2a7b196a3ec9298686a9be7411963106",
      "translation": "## Relationship with Other Specifications\n\n- [Technical Standards](../standards/) - The **technical** specification for adapters (session types, event transformations, API shapes); this directory is about **engineering and writing** discipline; the two are complementary and do not overlap.\n- `CONTRIBUTING.md` - Contribution process and CI gates (the machine-checkable parts of the rules in this directory are enforced by gate scripts).\n- `CHANGELOG.md` header \"Writing Guidelines\" - Detailed specification for change logs (this document only references it and does not repeat the main content)."
    }
  ]
}